# Generated artifacts must stay LF on every platform. The export/build steps
# write LF, but a Windows CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf) rewrites the working
# tree, and the CI gates compare bytes: "Verify skin-colors.json is
# up-to-date" trips on `git diff --exit-code`, and verify-release P3 reports
# every lib/ file as phantom drift — except files with no newline at all
# (lib/client.js.map), which is the fingerprint of a line-ending mismatch
# rather than real content drift.
src-tauri/src/skin-colors.json text eol=lf
lib/** text eol=lf
